Sat Nov 14 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of pgModeler 1.2.3, the last release with database
  import, model diff, SQL tool and database explorer in the open
  source build (2.0 moved them to the paid Plus edition; 2.x is
  packaged separately as pgmodeler2)
  * Update check disabled (updates come from the package)
  * Executables live in %{_libdir}/pgmodeler, with pgmodeler and
    pgmodeler-cli symlinks in %{_bindir}, so the $ORIGIN RUNPATH
    points at a library directory; the unversioned private sonames
    are kept out of Provides/Requires
  * Add a .desktop entry, icons and a MIME type for .dbm models
